# ==========================================================================
# WMSHEET.plus_exotics -- THE EIGHT VANILLA GUNS VANILLA+ NEVER HAD.
#
# Vanilla+ works by giving its own WM_VP_ copy of each Vanilla gun -- seventeen of them, so the
# super shotgun becomes WM_VP_SSG. EIGHT GUNS HAD NO COPY AT ALL, so choosing Vanilla+ lost them:
# the Unmaker, the Bolter, the Assault Shotgun, the BFG Rifle, the Plasma Carbine, the Longbar
# Chainsaw, the Rotary Gun and the Rotary Launcher. Every one is fully built -- model card,
# class, hand seats -- and Vanilla hands them out. Nothing was wrong with them; nobody had made
# the Vanilla+ twin. The owner asked for them on 2026-09-19.
#
# EVERY NUMBER HERE IS READ OFF THE VANILLA GUN'S OWN HANDWRITTEN CLASS, not invented and not
# re-derived: slot, selection order, ammo, tag, and its Shot* and FireTics properties. These are
# the same guns, so a difference would be a bug rather than a feature.
#
# `model = WM_<gun>` BORROWS the Vanilla gun's Model Card, which is how every other VP_ gun in
# this set works: same measurements, same parts, same sounds, its own class. So these inherit
# their firing and reload foley from the card and need no sound lines of their own.
#
# PROFILES ARE WIRED, AND SIX OF THE EIGHT ALREADY EXISTED AND HAD NEVER BEEN NAMED -- unmaker,
# bfg_9000, chainsaw_heavy, plasma_carbine, rocket_launcher and chaingun_556 have been in RSBDEFS
# since those guns were built and nobody pointed at them. Only what was genuinely absent was built.
#
# EACH NAMES EXACTLY WHAT ITS VANILLA ORIGINAL NAMES. They are the same guns, so a difference
# between a gun and its twin would be a bug rather than a feature.
#
# THE VANILLA ORIGINALS STILL NAME NOTHING. WM_Unmaker and the other seven have shared the house
# recipe since they were built -- an Unmaker and a Bolter fire with the same muzzle flash there
# today. That is the owner's call to make, not mine: Vanilla is off-limits without his word, and
# those guns have no sheet entry to put a line in.
# ==========================================================================

gun "WM_VP_Unmaker"
  model                = WM_Unmaker
  class
    slot               = 0
    selectionorder     = 2850
    ammo               = "Cell"
    hand               = main
    name               = "Unmaker"
    pickupmessage      = "Unmaker"
  end
  shotclass            = "WM_UnmakerBolt"
  firetics             = 1
  # BALLISTICS (RS_Ballistics 988C9E3). The SAME profiles its Vanilla original names --
  # they are the same gun, and a difference between them would be a bug, not a feature.
  # No roundprofile and no ejectaprofile: it fires a shotclass rather than a cartridge,
  # so there is no round to describe and no case to throw.
  flashprofile         = "unmaker"
  recoilprofile        = "unmaker"
end

gun "WM_VP_Bolter"
